  "description": "Dropouts\n2x rear fender eyelets, rear rack mounts, downtube water bottle mount\n\nZoom suspension fork 80mm travel, alloy crown, 32mm steel stanchions, alloy lowers, 1 1/8\" (28.6mm)\n\nShifter(s)\nShimano Rapidfire Plus, w/OGD & Clamp Band, SL-M315-8R\n\nCrankset\nProwheel 170mm x 46T w/double alloy chainguard\n\nBB\nSteel sealed cartridge, 120mm x 179mm; C+28.7mm\n\nRims\nAlloy single-wall, 26\" x 4.0 x 36H x 13G; for disc brake; ERD 385.2mm\n\nBrakes\nTektro HD-E350 hydraulic with ebike 180mm rotors and semi-metalic pads\n\nHandlebars\nAlloy 700mmW x 45mm Rise; 31.8mm diameter; 6° back sweep; 6° up sweep\n\nStem\nDie-Casting alloy; 31.8mm barbore; 60 mm extension; 6° rise; 41mm stack\n\nSeatpost\nDie-Casting alloy/alloy; 30.9mm diameter; 22mm offset; 400mm long\n\nPedals\nAlloy platform w/Boron spindle; ZU bearing; 9/16\"\n\nLight(s)\nIntegrated front and rear lights w/brake function\n\nTools\n4 pcs: 15mm open/box, 10mm open/box, 5/6mm hex key, cross (Phillips) screwdriver\n\nWeight - Bike (assembled w/battery)\n\nWeight - Max Rider\n350lbs / 158kgs not including bike weight.\n\nClass\n\nClass 2: pedal-assist and/or throttle-assisted, 20 mph max.\n\nE-System IP/IPX Rating\n\nMotor\n\n1 size motor/battery\n\nBattery (w/key & slide in/out housing)\n\nMotor\n\n48V/750W: brushless rear hub motor, 9-pin connector, MXUS\n\nBattery (w/key & slide in/out housing)\n\n48V/14.4Ah for 720W: Li-ion (NMC/Nickel Manganese Cobalt) + Charger w/US plug, w/power level display.\n\nUL Tested (Underwriters Laboratories) = Charger only\n\nDrive Mode, Display\n\nPAS/Thumb throttle Left side , cadence sensor, Full color display panel w/6 PAS levels (Pedal Assist System), w/walk mode 6kph (~4mph) King Meter K5303 LCD Display Head (NO touch-sensitive screen, BT, OTA).\n\nCharge Time (empty to full, estimated, could be longer)\n\nApproximetly 4hrs.\n\nWatt Hours (Wh)\n\n720Wh (48V x 14.4Ah)\n\nRange Conservative (@ 1mi = 20watt hours)\n\n45+\n\nRange - Miles Published\n\n-\n\n48V/750W: 45+ miles\n\nRange - Hours Riding",
